  "title": "CMake: Use cmake_dependent_option for strato[shark] extcaps",
  "description": "cmake_dependent_option has the slightly different (and better)\nbehavior of automatically disabling the dependent option if the\nnecessary option is disabled, but keeping the old value internally\nand restoring it if the necessary option is re-enabled.\n\nSo here, if stratoshark or strato is being built, and sshdig is\nenabled, disabling stratoshark and strato will cause sshdig to\nnot be built, but later reenabling one of them will cause sshdig\nto be built again.\n\nIt also hides impossible options in the GUI if that is being used.\nThere are other dependent options that it could be used for, but\nit's less important there, since those are mostly platform options\nthat shouldn't change for the same set of build files. (I.e., whether\na system is Linux or WIN32 or Apple.)\n\nhttps://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/module/CMakeDependentOption.html",
